    },
    {
      "id": "el_35",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 188.8,
      "width": 225.0,
      "height": 15.600000000000001,
      "text": "• 转速换算：r = (RPM ÷ 60) 转/秒",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "el_36",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 210.8,
      "width": 288.0,
      "height": 15.600000000000001,
      "text": "• 数据传输率：D = r × N （字节/秒，N 为每道容量）",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "el_37",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 232.8,
      "width": 351.0,
      "height": 15.600000000000001,
      "text": "• 非格式化总容量 = 记录面数 S × 柱面(磁道)数 C × 每道容量 N",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "el_38",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 254.8,
      "width": 324.0,
      "height": 15.600000000000001,
      "text": "• 单次读写总耗时：T_总 = Ts + 1/(2r) + b/(rN)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "strokeColor": "#0b6f66",
      "opacity": 100
    },
